        <referenceFunction amount="1" category="electronics" datasetRelatesToProduct="true" generalComment="The activity starts with the battery cells, module packaging and the materials for additional components (esternal case, tabs, etc.) entering the factory gate. The activity ends with the production of Li-ion battery pack. Data is also from original LCI reference from Crenna et al (2021). Towards more flexibility and transparency in life cycle inventories for Lithium-ion batteries.; UUID: 678e731c-148d-3bb2-b3db-11423011f7ce" includedProcesses="This dataset represents the production of 1 kg of Li-ion battery pack used e.g. for mechanical drive of an electric vehicle or portable consumer electronics. The inventory is modelled according to the publication of Dai et al. (2019), in which a battery pack with gross pack energy of 23.5 kWh made of 140 3.6 V- 46Ah prismatic cells is presented. Cells are made of nickel-manganese-cobalt (NMC111) cathode and a graphite-based anode, liquid electrolyte and a porous plastic separator. Infrastructure is included as well in this dataset as &quot;electronic component factory&quot;. This dataset is a copy of the corresponding regional dataset. Production volume was adjusted.;None;" infrastructureIncluded="false" infrastructureProcess="false" localCategory="electronics" localName="Battery, Li-ion, NMC111, rechargeable, prismatic" localSubCategory="batteries" name="Battery, Li-ion, NMC111, rechargeable, prismatic" subCategory="batteries" unit="kg">
